<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-30T16:06:18.086Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:06:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian Su-35 fighter jets and S-400 air defence systems have entered Ethiopia as fighting spreads across Tigray, Amhara and Oromia, and drone strikes have hit an IDP camp in Amhara and a shelter in South Wollo, causing civilian casualties. Militant attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in Oromia, and drone strikes in Amhara killed 14 civilians, including children. Thousands are fleeing border clashes, with about 50,000 refugees arriving in Moyale, Kenya. Ethiopia plans to withdraw more than 3,000 troops from Somalia. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261030-at-least-60-christians-killed-in-ethiopia-amid-rising-religious-violence&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObWxFck1EbEF1MjVtOFo5RFpsbHh0TFJDa251X2pPeEtISEI4UDVRZzR2ME5qS2NyRWw2Zi0wVWlUTkFIRVZ0d3JoanhFc3MzdlMtWlJaRTh1amh6cng0S0lDOFlvY2VUWDNabFpQaUl4clVLY0pHUXM0bzJZRzhJSzB3RmhiTE81eURZQUEzQzRKRzhSUjV4UFBVcmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFB2dUtyeUs4eU9CLWoxWGIyQkVXd045YUxiR2V5blloTkdyYm9PdXZ2RDItZ1hUdmE2OXp0cEN1d0ZaMlBRaGFXLXBwUklYYkJITnNsZzgzUF9falplbVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxONVpGUVlyMDQwVGFRVzhCYVUxNHpQczBZcHZ4MldfelpHaXNva3FnQlNTcVNGUzQ3eWFiNzRSMWtJQTEyRjU0SVdxTXVsRGladWRjS013LXIzZVdBZU9fWU1DQjhPMUlIMWFsWWJoWVkyLUNnX3l3QmJfYmM4X2NYOW5TVm1WYTJKeWZxSV9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google